        "text": "SOURCE POLICY\nSave primary and secondary sources, exact scope, freshness, dedupe key, conflict rule, and permission for each data type. Prefer live connectors. Paste, CSV, exports, URLs, and files are first-class fallbacks. Show source conflicts with timestamps; never merge silently. Save mappings and references, not full private content.",
