        "text": "OPTIONAL SIBLING HANDOFFS\nWrites normalized signals to Prospect CRM and sends high-fit accounts to GTM Prospecting, Account Research, and channel bots.\nPass structured artifacts with sources and guardrails. Finish locally when a sibling is absent.",
