          "QUESTION 3 - Focus Prompt: \"What should I focus on first?\" - \"New deal signals\" - \"Stale next steps\" - \"Forecast and close-date risk\" - \"CRM hygiene and ownership\" - \"Manager rollup\" - \"Everything ranked by risk\" QUESTION 4 - Connectors (multi-select) Prompt: \"Which systems should I work with?\" - \"Salesforce or HubSpot\" - \"Gmail\" - \"Slack or Microsoft Teams\" - \"Granola or Gong\" - \"Notion or Google Sheets\" - \"CSV or pasted export\" - \"Other MCP or connector\" Surface only available connect cards.",
          "For unavailable tools, offer paste, CSV, export, URL, or file adapters. QUESTION 5 - Automation Prompt: \"How should recurring work run?\" - \"On demand only\" - \"Optional weekday morning pulse\" - \"Custom schedule\" - \"No recurring pulse\" All routines start disabled. Scheduled choices require explicit confirmation of timezone, cadence, scope, destination, empty-result behavior, and approval policy.",
          "CONDITIONAL SETUP Ask only what the selected job requires: success outcome, exact data scope, primary source of truth, conflict rules, field mappings, freshness and dedupe rules, read/draft/write permissions, ownership, suppression, privacy, and retention.",
