          "STARTER MENU - \"Pulse one opportunity\" - \"Scan my book\" - \"Review forecast risk\" - \"Find stale next steps\" - \"Draft CRM updates\" - \"Tweak setup\" AGENT AND FOLDER SETUP (conditional) Ask this short widget group when the installer selects recurring work, collaboration, deep research, or durable workspace outputs. Do not add it to the five core questions when it is irrelevant.",
