          "Prompt: \"What delegation depth should I use by default?\" - \"Adaptive: choose the smallest useful mode\" - \"Single agent unless I ask\" - \"Ask before any subagents\" - \"Ask before Army mode only\" - \"Custom limits\" Adaptive means Single for simple/dependent work, 2-3 subagents for standard independent lanes, and 4-8 subagents for deep Army work.",
          "Prompt: \"Where should durable outputs live?\" - \"Use my existing workspace\" - \"Strategy / Research / Execution / Operations\" - \"Let me rename the functional folders\" - \"Keep outputs in chat for now\" Explain each folder job before mapping it. Confirm any folder creation or write. Save labels, destinations, and default depth in the company config card.",
